 at 9 months pregnant, she gets a call from a woman claiming to be a caseworker offering baby supplies. But Teka soon learns that the woman has something much more horrifying in mind.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-12\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Pain and Gain\",\"overview\":\"When successful Miami businessman Marc Schiller is ambushed by a gang of thugs in broad daylight, his nightmare is just beginning. Blindfolded and bound, Marc learns that the men hell-bent on killing him have a special kind of torture in store for him.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-19\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Innocence Lost\",\"overview\":\"Alicia Kozakiewicz was a typical 13-year old who made friends in chat rooms. But when she agreed to meet Scott Tyree in person, she had no idea he was a 38-year-old sadistic pedophile.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-03-26\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Toy Box Killer\",\"overview\":\"Cynthia Vigil is a street-smart teen from Albuquerque... But a fateful meeting ends with Cynthia in chains and forced into the horrifying world of the Toy Box Killer Â- a madman who, along with his girlfriend, subjects Cynthia to a world of torture and fear.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-02\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Building Betrayal\",\"overview\":\"Peter Brandt could never have predicted the dark secrets he would uncover when he invited a brilliant contractor into his home. After a vicious attack, Peter must manipulate the madman threatening his life into setting him free.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-09\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Terror By the Letter\",\"overview\":\"A women's ex-boyfriend takes her hostage while on a  roadtrip\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-16\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Road to Hell\",\"overview\":\"Best friends Brandi and Liz are two small town teens who were taught to help others in need. So when a young man asks them for a ride to his house, they decide to oblige. But they soon discover the man intends for this to ride to be their last.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-23\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The End of the Road\",\"overview\":\"The story of Arkansas couple Sam and Suzanne Peebles, who spotted someone in need on the roadside and pulled over to help - little realizing the stranger was a wanted murderer.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-04-30\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"A Madman Walks Into a Bar\",\"overview\":\"When a crazed gunman storms into an East Village bar, Ann-Margret Gidley and her friends scramble for a way to escape. Trapped in a back room with no way out, Ann-Margret must summon a strength she didn't know she had to take down the shooter.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-05-07\",\"runtime\":21},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Human Currency\",\"overview\":\"Two young girls are kidnapped by two pimps and forced to prostitute themselves.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2014-05-14\",\"runtime\":21}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2014-02-26\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}